#: src/pages/help/FAQ.tsx
msgid "Achievements for skill levels, dedication, mastery and ranked play, plus a few secret ones. They are awarded on the result screen of a ranked play. Each medal permanently raises your experience gain, from {bronzeBonus}% for a bronze one to {divineBonus}% for a divine one, and the bonuses stack."
